+# Copyright (c) 2026 OCP Hardware-Fault-Management project
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+
+description: |
+  RISC-V RERI (RAS Error-record Register Interface) error bank.
+
+  Models a RERI v1.0 error bank as an MMIO device: a 64-byte header followed
+  by up to 63 error records of 64 bytes each. The abstract RERI RAS signal is
+  delivered as a single interrupt (wired to the PLIC on the sifive_u machine).
+
+compatible: "sifive,reri"
+
+include: base.yaml
+
+properties:
+  reg:
+    required: true
+  interrupts:
+    required: true
